sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser
  participant H as Route handler
  participant BA as Better Auth
  participant T as after() task
  participant R as Redis
  participant D as Postgres
  participant M as Mailer

  B->>H: POST /sign-in/magic-link { email, callbackURL }
  H->>BA: rebuilt request
  BA->>BA: sendMagicLink: normalize email, read device cookie, resolve IP
  Note over BA: same cost for every address
  BA->>T: schedule with the captured values
  BA-->>H: 200
  H-->>B: { status: true } for every address
  T->>D: eligibility: user, or pending unexpired invitation
  alt not eligible
    T->>T: stop, nothing sent
  else eligible
    T->>R: sign-in email limits
    alt a limit trips
      T->>D: delete the stored link, audit auth.sign_in_throttled
    else within limits
      T->>BA: issue the 6-digit code
      T->>M: one email: the confirm link, token in its fragment, and the code
    end
  end
